    {
      "id": "annotation-employee-auth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 455,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 433,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3b82f6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1018,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1018,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step: GetEmployeeAuthorization (DataCollectionSteps=1)\n\n• Loads security model for badge holder\n• Any 5-digit integer accepted (since 2/24/2015)\n• If no security record → default access granted\n  (UnitClaimingUser=true, Overrider=false,\n  Admin=false, KeyboardEntryAllowed=false)\n• Badge cached in MDI parent for session\n• On success → loads PlantLocation, advances to\n  GetPartNumber\n• DeniedAccess step (0) shown if no rights\n\nPanel1 hosts an EmployeeNumber control\n(implements IDataCollectionControl.GetInput())",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step: GetEmployeeAuthorization (DataCollectionSteps=1)\n\n• Loads security model for badge holder\n• Any 5-digit integer accepted (since 2/24/2015)\n• If no security record → default access granted\n  (UnitClaimingUser=true, Overrider=false,\n  Admin=false, KeyboardEntryAllowed=false)\n• Badge cached in MDI parent for session\n• On success → loads PlantLocation, advances to\n  GetPartNumber\n• DeniedAccess step (0) shown if no rights\n\nPanel1 hosts an EmployeeNumber control\n(implements IDataCollectionControl.GetInput())",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 455,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 433,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1019,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1019,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Navigation:\n• Previous button DISABLED at this step\n• Next (Enter) enabled → advances to GetPartNumber\n• Enter key = Next (AcceptButton)\n• Esc = Previous (CancelButton, disabled here)\n\nOn badge entry:\n1. Save EmployeeNumber to model + MDI cache\n2. Load security via LoadSecurityModel()\n3. Set PlantLocation from user config\n4. controller.CurrentDataCollectionStep = GetPartNumber\n5. PrepareForm() swaps panel1 to PartNumber control",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Navigation:\n• Previous button DISABLED at this step\n• Next (Enter) enabled → advances to GetPartNumber\n• Enter key = Next (AcceptButton)\n• Esc = Previous (CancelButton, disabled here)\n\nOn badge entry:\n1. Save EmployeeNumber to model + MDI cache\n2. Load security via LoadSecurityModel()\n3. Set PlantLocation from user config\n4. controller.CurrentDataCollectionStep = GetPartNumber\n5. PrepareForm() swaps panel1 to PartNumber control",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
